# QGroundControl QML Integration Patterns

## QML-C++ Integration Architecture

### Service Exposure Pattern
```cpp
// In QGroundControlQmlGlobal.h
Q_PROPERTY(MissionService* missionService READ missionService CONSTANT)

// In QGroundControlQmlGlobal.cc
MissionService* missionService() { return _missionService; }
```

### QML Usage Pattern
```qml
// In PlanToolBarIndicators.qml
Connections {
    target: QGroundControl.missionService
    enabled: QGroundControl.missionService !== null
    function onMissionGenerationStarted() {
        console.log("Mission generation started");
    }
}
```

## Signal/Slot Patterns

### C++ Signal Declaration
```cpp
// In MissionService.h
signals:
    void missionGenerationStarted();
    void missionGenerationCompleted(bool success, const QString& message);
    void addTakeoffItemRequested(const QGeoCoordinate& coordinate, int altitude, int targetVehicle);
    void addWaypointItemRequested(const QGeoCoordinate& coordinate, int altitude, int targetVehicle);
    void addLandItemRequested(const QGeoCoordinate& coordinate, int targetVehicle);
```

### QML Signal Handling
```qml
// In PlanToolBarIndicators.qml
Connections {
    target: QGroundControl.missionService
    enabled: QGroundControl.missionService !== null
    
    function onMissionGenerationStarted() {
        ptahDialog.text = qsTr("Generating mission...");
        ptahDialog.visible = true;
    }
    
    function onMissionGenerationCompleted(success, message) {
        ptahDialog.text = success ? 
            qsTr("Mission generated successfully!\n") + message :
            qsTr("Mission generation failed!\n") + message;
        ptahDialog.visible = true;
    }
}
```

## QML Dialog Patterns

### Modal Dialog Structure
```qml
// In MissionGeneratorDialogue.qml
Dialog {
    id: missionDialog
    title: qsTr("Mission Generator")
    modal: true
    anchors.centerIn: parent
    
    // Dialog content
    Column {
        spacing: 10
        
        // Mission type selection
        ComboBox {
            id: missionTypeCombo
            model: ["Survey", "Waypoint", "Orbit", "Custom"]
        }
        
        // Parameter inputs
        SpinBox {
            id: areaSizeSpinBox
            from: 10
            to: 1000
            value: 20
        }
    }
    
    // Action buttons
    Row {
        Button {
            text: qsTr("Cancel")
            onClicked: missionDialog.close()
        }
        Button {
            text: qsTr("Generate Mission")
            onClicked: {
                // Extract parameters and emit signal
                missionGenerated(missionTypeCombo.currentText, 
                               areaSizeSpinBox.value, 
                               altitudeSpinBox.value, 
                               speedSpinBox.value)
                missionDialog.close()
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## Null Safety Patterns

### Always Check for Null
```qml
// Check if service is available before connecting
Connections {
    target: QGroundControl.missionService
    enabled: QGroundControl.missionService !== null
    // ... signal handlers
}

// Check for null in functions
function addTakeoffItem(coordinate, altitude, targetVehicle) {
    if (!coordinate || !coordinate.isValid) {
        console.warn("Invalid coordinate provided");
        return;
    }
    // ... rest of function
}
```

### Safe Property Access
```qml
// Use optional chaining or null checks
property bool hasMissionService: QGroundControl.missionService !== null

// Conditional UI elements
Button {
    text: qsTr("Generate Mission")
    enabled: hasMissionService
    onClicked: {
        if (hasMissionService) {
            QGroundControl.missionService.generateMission(/* parameters */);
        }
    }
}
```

## Debugging Patterns

### QML Debug Logging
```qml
// Function entry logging
function onMissionGenerationStarted() {
    console.log("GenCall7: Mission generation started signal received");
    // ... rest of function
}

// Parameter logging
function addWaypointItem(coordinate, altitude, targetVehicle) {
    console.log("GenCall66: Adding waypoint item at", coordinate.toString(), 
                "altitude", altitude, "to vehicle", targetVehicle);
    // ... rest of function
}

// Error logging
function onMissionGenerationCompleted(success, message) {
    if (!success) {
        console.warn("Mission generation failed:", message);
    } else {
        console.log("Mission generation completed successfully:", message);
    }
}
```

## UI State Management

### Dialog State Management
```qml
// Dialog visibility control
property bool isDialogOpen: false

function openDialog() {
    isDialogOpen = true;
    missionDialog.open();
}

function closeDialog() {
    isDialogOpen = false;
    missionDialog.close();
}

// Prevent multiple dialogs
Button {
    text: qsTr("Generate Mission")
    enabled: !isDialogOpen
    onClicked: openDialog()
}
```

### Progress Indication
```qml
// Progress bar for long operations
ProgressBar {
    id: progressBar
    visible: missionGenerationInProgress
    indeterminate: true
}

// Status text updates
Text {
    text: missionGenerationInProgress ? 
          qsTr("Generating mission...") : 
          qsTr("Ready")
}
```

## Error Handling Patterns

### User-Friendly Error Messages
```qml
// Error dialog
Dialog {
    id: errorDialog
    title: qsTr("Error")
    Text {
        text: errorMessage
        wrapMode: Text.WordWrap
    }
    standardButtons: Dialog.Ok
}

// Error handling function
function handleError(errorMessage) {
    console.error("Error occurred:", errorMessage);
    errorDialog.text = errorMessage;
    errorDialog.open();
}
```

### Validation Patterns
```qml
// Input validation
function validateInputs() {
    if (areaSizeSpinBox.value < 10) {
        return qsTr("Area size must be at least 10 meters");
    }
    if (altitudeSpinBox.value < 5) {
        return qsTr("Altitude must be at least 5 meters");
    }
    return "";
}

// Use validation before action
Button {
    text: qsTr("Generate Mission")
    onClicked: {
        var validationError = validateInputs();
        if (validationError) {
            handleError(validationError);
            return;
        }
        // Proceed with mission generation
    }
}
```